        "New top-level comments go to the top of the list. Ignore comments that are empty or only spaces, and clear the box after adding.",
        "Add the class `reply-button` to every Reply button. Clicking it opens a reply box under that comment and closes any other reply box.",
        "Post adds the reply after that comment's existing replies and closes the box. Cancel closes the box and adds nothing."
